        <div style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
          <span style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a;">29&#8364;</span>
          <span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b;">/mois</span>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.5;">Coaching nutrition + suivi pour les patients deja sous traitement GLP-1.</p>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 28px; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #334155; line-height: 2.2;">
          <li>✅ Plan nutrition personnalise</li>
          <li>✅ Coach IA 24/7</li>
          <li>✅ Ajustements mensuels</li>
          <li>✅ Recettes et listes de courses</li>
          <li>✅ Gestion effets secondaires</li>
          <li style="color: #94a3b8;">— Teleconsultation non incluse</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/guides/quel-traitement-glp1-choisir/" style="display: block; text-align: center; background: white; color: #0f172a; padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; border: 2px solid #e2e8f0; transition: all 0.2s;">Commencer</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Plan Complet (recommended) -->
      <div style="background: white; border-radius: 20px; padding: 36px 28px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.15); border: 2px solid #16a34a; position: relative;">
        <div style="position: absolute; top: -12px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); background: #16a34a; color: white; padding: 4px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700;">Le plus populaire</div>
